Description: A House service to control and read GPIO pins on a RPi Pico
 HousePicod is part of the House suite of web services.
 .
 HousePicod allow remote services to control and read the GPIO pins of
 Raspberry Pi Pico boards running the picod firmware. This service can
 run on any Linux machine that has USB ports.

